{"id":"627383","name":"干贝薄荷蛋炒饭","author":"爱在夏郢","authorId":"11343633","desc":"","cover":"images/627383/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一颗"},{"name":"干贝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"薄荷","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"干贝泡几分钟洗干净。","img":"images/627383/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"薄荷切碎。","img":"images/627383/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"热锅下油，放入干贝翻炒。","img":"images/627383/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加点水煮一下以确保干贝煮熟。","img":"images/627383/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把煮好的干贝扒拉到一边。","img":"images/627383/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"打入鸡蛋迅速炒散。","img":"images/627383/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蛋液将凝未凝之时倒入米饭快速翻炒。","img":"images/627383/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入生抽老抽炒匀。","img":"images/627383/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅前放入蚝油，薄荷。盐的话看情况要不要加。","img":"images/627383/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒匀即可。","img":"images/627383/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}